### PerfumeShop – Payments module: COD payments, fiscal receipts (NON-FISCAL in Development), daily cash
#
# Run the API first:  dotnet run --project src/Bootstrapper/PerfumeShop.Api   (http://localhost:5080)
# Payments has no "write" endpoints for money: it follows Orders and Shipping events (outbox, every 30 s).
# Run Orders.http (place + confirm) and Shipping.http (ship, deliver, settle / refuse + return) first,
# wait ~30 s for the outbox jobs, then look at the results here.
# In Development receipts come from the development provider: stored in the DB, number "NONFISCAL-…",
# printed with "JO FISKAL – NON-FISCAL". Outside Development every receipt fails until a real provider exists.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payments
@adminEmail = you@example.com
@adminPassword = change-me

### Sign in (Admin or Staff)
# @name signIn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/staff/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

@token = {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}


################################################################################
### 1. PAYMENTS
################################################################################

### Latest payments (filters: status Expected|Collected|Failed|Cancelled, from, to (Kosovo days), courier, orderNumber)
# @name payments
GET {{api}}?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@orderId = {{payments.response.body.$.items[0].orderId}}

### Payment of one order with its receipts (sale + storno) and every attempt (request/response JSON)
# @name payment
GET {{api}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Collected payments of one courier in a period (courier fee + net received from the statement)
GET {{api}}?status=Collected&courier=Posta&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refused parcels (payment Failed)
GET {{api}}?status=Failed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid status → 400
GET {{api}}?status=Paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


################################################################################
### 2. DAILY CASH SUMMARY PER COURIER
################################################################################

### Today (Kosovo time): shipped/expected, collected, fees, net, still at the courier, failed receipts
GET {{api}}/daily-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A given day
GET {{api}}/daily-summary?date=2026-11-26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


################################################################################
### 3. RECEIPTS
################################################################################

### Receipts (filters: status Pending|Issued|Failed|Voided, kind Sale|Storno, orderNumber)
# @name receipts
GET {{api}}/receipts?kind=Sale&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@receiptId = {{receipts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}

### One receipt: lines with batch codes, 18% VAT breakdown, total, attempts
GET {{api}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Printable receipt (HTML) – shows "JO FISKAL – NON-FISCAL – VETËM PËR TESTIM" in Development
GET {{api}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}/print
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Storno receipts (refused parcels back in the warehouse), linked to their sale
GET {{api}}/receipts?kind=Storno
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Receipts that could not be issued
# @name failed
GET {{api}}/receipts?status=Failed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry a failed receipt (same internal number, a new attempt is stored). Issued receipts → 409.
POST {{api}}/receipts/{{failed.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
